    y = text('Once leaders recognize the pattern, the most important question becomes: where should leadership attention focus to restore signal clarity and decision alignment? Structural patterns do not shift through effort alone. They recalibrate when leaders adjust how signals move, how interpretations stabilize, and how decisions are paced under pressure.', ML, y, { lineHeight: 1.8 });

